{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "qa-guide",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1180,
      "y": -820,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 680,
      "text": "# Miro Canvas M1-M3 acceptance board\n\nUse **Fit board** and open **Miro Canvas controls**.\n\n- [ ] Plugin status is `ready/valid/ready/ready`\n- [ ] Six local M2 shapes render distinctly\n- [ ] Comments show unresolved, replies and resolved states\n- [ ] Free/node/image/edge anchors are listed in M2 tools\n- [ ] Local document opens; image stays local\n- [ ] Rotations include local `0`, local negative and source geometry\n- [ ] Overlap reads FRONT over MIDDLE over BACK\n- [ ] Source-backed shape, text, sticky, frame, document, image and connector render\n- [ ] Unknown shape falls back without losing `miroSource`\n- [ ] Review mode is off; locked item is protected\n- [ ] Make one edit, then Undo and Redo; metadata and source remain intact",
      "futureNodeField": {
        "sentinel": "keep-guide-node"
      }
    },
    {
